flowchart TD
    Start([Start Exam Session]) --> Login[Enter Credentials & Passcode]
    Login --> Consent[Accept 10-Demerit Rules & Grant Camera]
    Consent --> InitModel[Initialize Agent ELI YOLOv11 & Browser Traps]
    InitModel --> ExamLoop[Active Examination Loop]

    ExamLoop --> CheckEvent{Event Triggered?}
    
    CheckEvent -->|Shortcut Pressed| ShortcutDecision{1st Time Attempt?}
    ShortcutDecision -->|Yes| WarnModal[Show Warning Modal 0 pts]
    ShortcutDecision -->|No| Add1Pt[+1 Demerit Point]
    WarnModal --> ExamLoop
    Add1Pt --> CheckDemerits

    CheckEvent -->|Page Reload F5 / Ctrl+R| ReloadSubmit[Instant Auto-Submit via Beacon API]
    
    CheckEvent -->|Tab Switch or Blur| TabPenalty[+2 Demerit Points]
    TabPenalty --> AwayCheck{Away > 10 Seconds?}
    AwayCheck -->|Yes| TabCountdown[5s Countdown Auto-Submit Modal]
    AwayCheck -->|No| CheckDemerits
    TabCountdown -->|Dismissed or Timeout| TabSubmit[Instant Auto-Submit]
    TabCountdown -->|Returned within 5s| CheckDemerits

    CheckEvent -->|Phone Visible >= 5s| PhoneModal[5s Confirmation Modal]
    PhoneModal -->|Unconfirmed| PhoneSubmit[Auto-Submit Exam]
    PhoneModal -->|Confirmed Removed| CheckDemerits

    CheckEvent -->|Book or Notes Detected| BookPenalty[+1 Demerit Point per 5s]
    BookPenalty --> CheckDemerits

    CheckEvent -->|Network Disconnected| NetHold[Lock Answering & Show 5-Min Hold Modal]
    NetHold --> NetCheck{Restored within 5 Min?}
    NetCheck -->|Yes| ResumeExam[Resume Answering & Log Network Restored]
    NetCheck -->|No > 5 Min| NetSubmit[Auto-Submit Exam]
    ResumeExam --> ExamLoop

    CheckDemerits{Total Demerits >= 10?}
    CheckDemerits -->|Yes| CeilingSubmit[Immediate Auto-Submit on 10 Demerits]
    CheckDemerits -->|No| Answering[Continue Answering 30s Auto-Save]
    Answering --> UserSubmit{User Clicked Submit or Timer Expired?}
    UserSubmit -->|Yes| NormalSubmit[Submit Completed Answers]
    UserSubmit -->|No| ExamLoop

    ReloadSubmit --> End([Exam Finalized & Locked])
    TabSubmit --> End
    PhoneSubmit --> End
    NetSubmit --> End
    CeilingSubmit --> End
    NormalSubmit --> End